msgid "Other languages"
msgstr "Andere Sprachen"

msgid ""
"The Godot developers officially support the following languages for Godot:"
msgstr ""
"Die Godot-Entwickler unterstützen offiziell die folgenden Sprachen für Godot:"

msgid ":ref:`GDScript (all versions)<doc_gdscript>`"
msgstr ":ref:`GDScript (alle Versionen)<doc_gdscript>`"

msgid ":ref:`C# (.NET version)<doc_c_sharp>`"
msgstr ":ref:`C# (.NET-Version)<doc_c_sharp>`"

msgid ":ref:`C++ (via GDExtension) <doc_godot_cpp>`"
msgstr ":ref:`C++ (über GDExtension) <doc_godot_cpp>`"

msgid ""
"There are no plans to support additional languages officially. That said, "
"the community offers several bindings for other languages (see below)."
msgstr ""
"Es gibt keine Pläne, weitere Sprachen offiziell zu unterstützen. Allerdings "
"bietet die Community mehrere Bindings für andere Sprachen an (siehe unten)."

msgid "The bindings below are developed and maintained by the community:"
msgstr ""
"Die folgenden Bindings werden von der Community entwickelt und gepflegt:"

msgid "`D <https://github.com/godot-dlang/godot-dlang>`__"
msgstr "`D <https://github.com/godot-dlang/godot-dlang>`__"

msgid "`Go <https://github.com/grow-graphics/gd>`__"
msgstr "`Go <https://github.com/grow-graphics/gd>`__"

msgid "`Kotlin/JVM <https://github.com/utopia-rise/godot-kotlin-jvm>`__"
msgstr "`Kotlin/JVM <https://github.com/utopia-rise/godot-kotlin-jvm>`__"

msgid "`Nim <https://github.com/godot-nim/gdext-nim>`__"
msgstr "`Nim <https://github.com/godot-nim/gdext-nim>`__"

msgid "`Rust <https://github.com/godot-rust/gdext>`__"
msgstr "`Rust <https://github.com/godot-rust/gdext>`__"

msgid "`Swift <https://github.com/migueldeicaza/SwiftGodot>`__"
msgstr "`Swift <https://github.com/migueldeicaza/SwiftGodot>`__"

msgid "`Odin <https://github.com/dresswithpockets/odin-godot>`__"
msgstr "`Odin <https://github.com/dresswithpockets/odin-godot>`__"

msgid ""
"Not all bindings mentioned here may be production-ready. Make sure to "
"research options thoroughly before starting a project with one of those. "
"Also, double-check whether the binding is compatible with the Godot version "
"you're using."
msgstr ""
"Nicht alle hier erwähnten Bindings sind für den produktiven Einsatz "
"geeignet. Informieren Sie sich gründlich über die Optionen, bevor Sie ein "
"Projekt mit einer dieser Bindings beginnen. Prüfen Sie auch, ob das Binding "
"mit der von Ihnen verwendeten Godot-Version kompatibel ist."
